  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sqwQjHY.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3xlgCgv.png\"></p><h2><strong>Hellim Studios 呈献 - Create: World of Gears 模組包</strong></h2><p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Hellim's Projects 自豪地推出這款圍繞 Create 模組精心打造的模組包。透過數十個精心挑選的擴充模組，創新的可能性幾乎無窮無盡。在這機械奇觀之中，我們整合了許多提升生存體驗的生活品質（QoL）模組。此外，我們還加入了數個在維持遊戲核心精神的同時，增添深度與變化的模組。除此之外，您還會找到與 Create 完美整合的模組，例如 Create Aeronautics、Create: The Factory Must Grow 和 Create: Ultimate Factory。當然，我們也透過納入 Farmer's Delight、Sophisticated Backpacks 和 Storage Drawers 等模組，提升了您的 Create 體驗，確保帶來豐富且沉浸式的遊戲體驗。</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">帶著你的齒輪，航向地平線吧...</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7u1sNQN.png\"></p><p><strong>🔹滿載大量擴充模組！</strong> <br><strong>➖超過 50 個 Create 擴充模組</strong></p><p><strong>🔹透過生活品質模組，你的生存體驗已獲提升。</strong> <br><strong>➖超過 30 個 QoL 模組</strong></p><p><strong>🔹藉由效能與伺服器支援模組，我們以低系統需求提供高效能。</strong> <br><strong>➖效能提升 30%，FPS 提高 40%。</strong></p><p><strong>🔹完整光影支援。已用最吃效能的輕影包測試過。</strong> <br><strong>➖使用一般裝置搭配 Complementary Shaders（極致設定），最低 144 FPS。</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BhH6Jd3.png\"></p><ul>\n<li>此專案以「版權所有，保留所有權利」授權。</li>\n<li>如有任何與模組包相關的問題、錯誤或建議，請透過我們的 Discord 伺服器回報。</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wdzAqcI.png\"></p><h2><strong>🔹效能模組</strong></h2><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ol style=\"padding-left:1em\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/achievements-optimizer\" rel=\"nofollow\">成就優化器</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alternate-current\" rel=\"nofollow\">替代電流</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/badpackets\" rel=\"nofollow\">不良封包</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/badoptimizations\" rel=\"nofollow\">不良優化</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-fps-render-distance-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">更好的 FPS - 渲染距離</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/client-crafting\" rel=\"nofollow\">客戶端合成</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/clumps\" rel=\"nofollow\">經驗聚合</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/connectivity\" rel=\"nofollow\">連線優化</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cull-less-leaves\" rel=\"nofollow\">減少樹葉渲染</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/debugify\" rel=\"nofollow\">除錯優化</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enhanced-block-entities\" rel=\"nofollow\">增強方塊實體</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fast-async-world-save-forge-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">快速異步世界存檔</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ferritecore-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">鐵氧體核心</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fix-gpu-memory-leak\" rel=\"nofollow\">修復 GPU 記憶體洩漏</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immediatelyfast\" rel=\"nofollow\">立即加速</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/indium\" rel=\"nofollow\">銦</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irisshaders\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iris 光影</a></span></li>\n<li><span sty